# Stage 19 — Retrospective

Write `retrospective/book_retrospective.md`: what went well, recurring problems,
defect families encountered, and decisions worth reusing. Write
`retrospective/template_update_suggestions.md`: concrete improvements for the
reference docs / skills / prompts (so future books benefit).

If any reusable translation-quality defect family was found during this book,
confirm it has been backfilled into
`skills/translation-quality-defect-families/SKILL.md`; otherwise record
`NOT_APPLICABLE` with a reason.

Then `set_state` -> `RETROSPECTIVE_DONE`, step `19_retrospective_template_update`,
and finally `set_state` -> `DONE`.

Exit condition: both retrospective files exist; state DONE.
